WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.860
You need twelve to eighteen index cards, crayons or markers, and a ball of yarn.

2
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.220
Draw one card each for sun, grass, grasshopper, frog, snake, and hawk.

3
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.360
Line them up by who eats whom.

4
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.020
Each person holds one to three cards.

5
00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.880
Start at the grass and pass the yarn from each food to its eater.

6
00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:25.833
Pull one card out and give the yarn a small tug.

7
00:00:26.773 --> 00:00:28.573
Anyone who feels it raises a hand.

8
00:00:29.393 --> 00:00:32.233
Take out the grass, then ask who loses their food first.

9
00:00:33.217 --> 00:00:34.977
Stay with your child the whole time.

10
00:00:35.897 --> 00:00:40.337
Never put yarn around a neck, and do not wrap it tightly around fingers or wrists.

11
00:00:41.197 --> 00:00:42.677
Nobody walks while holding yarn.
